  "title": "Visual Naming EC",
  "description": "This dataset contains intracranial EEG (iEEG) recordings from 110 individuals performing a visual picture-naming task. Events mark stimulus onset and response onset, and electrode coordinates are provided in MNI-305 (fsaverage) space. The data were used to build a whole-brain millisecond-scale effective connectivity atlas of visual and auditory naming.",
  "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG was recorded in EDF format during a visual naming task, with event codes 401 for stimulus onset and 501 for response onset. Electrode coordinates were transformed into FreeSurfer fsaverage/MNI305 space. Channel metadata were harmonized with the data file headers, including bipolar derivations.",
